<title>UK: BOE allots 175 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 175 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 175 million stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted 114 million stg in bills outright and 61 million stg in repos to July 14 and 15. The Bank's repo rate ws unchanged at 6.5 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank revised its forecast for today's money market shortage to 1.3 billion stg from the earlier estimate of 1.25 billion.</p>
</text>
